w(f"**Neither saved network reproduces the SI** (full CSV test: R2 {S['models']['model/thermal_model.pkl']['full CSV test']['r2']:.3f} and {S['models']['saved_models/thermal_model_52mae.pkl']['full CSV test']['r2']:.3f} against 0.41; RMSE {S['models']['model/thermal_model.pkl']['full CSV test']['rmse']:.1f} and {S['models']['saved_models/thermal_model_52mae.pkl']['full CSV test']['rmse']:.1f} against 67). The 32 MOFs that overlap with a network's training part have R2 0.8-0.9 and raise the full-test R2 only slightly.")
