w(f"Released recipe as coded (leaky-ReLU net 170-2048-1024-512-256-128-64-32-1, Adam lr 1e-4, batch 512, patience 100, max 1000 epochs, MSE on unscaled temperatures, StandardScaler on the 80% training part, 10% validation split with `random_state=0`, early-stopping restore is a no-op in {int(base.restore_noop.sum())}/{len(base)} runs), CSV split, `torch.manual_seed(s)` before building the network, s = 0..49.")
w()
w("| statistic | R2 | RMSE | MAE |")
