    w(f"CIFs found for {G['n_with_cif']} of the {G['n_names']:,} optimof MOFs (thermal and solvent through `CoRE_name`; water MOFs only when their name is a CoRE refcode). MOFid run status: {st}. Usable MOFid (non-empty building blocks): **{G['n_mofid']:,} MOFs ({100 * G['n_mofid'] / G['n_names']:.1f}% of all)**; {G['distinct_mofid_full']:,} distinct full MOFids and {G['distinct_mofid_bb']:,} distinct building-block keys. Topology is `ERROR` or `UNKNOWN` for {G['n_topology_error_or_unknown']:,} of them (their building blocks are still defined).")
